			"notes": "# CRITICAL BUG FIXES\n- Golems can now be created again... not sure how that failed. I swear I tested the 1.4.5 release.\n- Lapis golems are now much less laggy upon spawning, behaviour not improved.\n- Furnace golems, Blast Furnace Golems and Smoker Golems are no longer impossible to interact with without a crash.\n\nI'm sorry. I shouldn't have even called 1.4.5 a release. lol."
